# Kris Tong Portfolio

**Read `CLAUDE.md` in the repository root before making any changes.** It is the
single canonical source for this project's architecture, layout and writing
conventions, `<head>` requirements, the process for adding a project, how to
preview and verify changes, and the current list of known issues.

This file intentionally holds no detail of its own. Keeping a second copy of the
same context here caused the two to drift out of sync — the version that lived
here had gone stale on the project count, the shared chrome script, and the
deployed site URL. Record project context in `CLAUDE.md` only, and it stays
correct for every tool that reads it.
